# Review: HandpanPlugin

Phase 1 is built and the analysis layer is well tested. `Analyzer` runs a peak-normalized spectral-flux
`OnsetDetector`, merges onsets within 100 ms, and measures pitch from 8192-sample windows either side of
the onset; `audio.test.ts` checks overlapping D Kurd notes within 5 cents, level independence, taks,
calibration and the pitch tracker, and `chord.test.ts` checks the NNLS chord decomposer, resonance
attribution and the D3+D4 octave limit. `Tuner` and its sub-components have stories but no play
functions, so the UI-only requirements (reset and redo, persistence, gain and sensitivity sliders, level
threshold) have no automated check, and nothing runs QA-1.

Of 27 items: 22 done, 4 untested, 0 partial, 0 diverged, 1 missing.

## Extensions

| Term      | URI                        |
